    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic artisits and others have looked for ways to express their response to this unprecedented moment in time.  AKU-ISMC alumna, Ayse Gokcen Yucel, has been working on a project called \n       Covidoscope , produced and curated by the \n          Yunus Emre Institute .  This special project features dozens of international artists, from illustrators to musicians and filmmakers, whose work offers a rich kaleidoscope of emotions and experiences of the past year.",
